# Prettier covers the application source only. The sheets under src/styles and
# src/themes are hand-tuned (and deliberately compact in places): reformatting
# 26k lines of CSS would bury every real change in whitespace, so CSS stays out
# of the formatter. Same for build output and the lockfile.
dist
node_modules
package-lock.json
src/styles.css
src/styles/**
src/themes/**/*.css
src/member/*.css
src/team/*.css
